# Large intermediate files (already excluded from this repo — see DATA_AVAILABILITY.md)
#
# NOT a bare `distances.tsv`: that pattern matched by filename alone, with no
# path, and its only match anywhere in this repo was
# tests/fixtures/synthetic_cohort/distances.tsv -- a 46KB test fixture, not
# real case-study data. It was never committed as a result, which every local
# checkout had anyway (generated by make_synthetic_cohort.py) but a fresh
# clone -- including every CI runner -- genuinely did not, failing four tests
# with "file not found" the moment the real fixture was needed. Found only
# because CI ran on an actual fresh clone; every local run passed. The real
# case-study distance matrices are named specifically below and excluded by
# that specific name, not by "distances.tsv" as a filename pattern.
distances_filtered.tsv
distances_final.tsv
core.full.aln
*.aln.fai

# Explicit allow-list, belt and braces: this file must never be re-excluded
# by a future, broader distances*.tsv-style pattern added above.
!tests/fixtures/synthetic_cohort/distances.tsv

